      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>] from a disagreement(?) in Fus\u1e6d\u0101t&hellip;.debtors(?)</li>\n<li>] 3 dinars, and promised that towards</li>\n<li>] the slave, unveiling of that he narrated about his state and charity to him</li>\n<li>] so that he can live with it. And to our master, may God&rsquo;s blessings be upon him, belongs the lofty resolution</li>\n<li>regarding this] if God wills.</li>\n<li>All praise be to God&hellip;&hellip;</li>\n<li>and his blessings on&hellip;..and peace</li></ol>\n",
